comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:37:57.246Z",codex-root,"Reproduction used a temporary directory and boolean-only inspection; no credential, URL, location, or live payload entered PM or Git."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:37:57.246Z",codex-root,The interactive path may remain conversational. The non-interactive contract must route all normal stdout through formatOutput exactly once.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:37:57.246Z",codex-root,Secure file permissions are necessary but insufficient for agent-safe setup; stdout itself is a public API contract.
