body: "Reproduced with an isolated HASSIO_CONFIG directory and token supplied only through the environment. The wizard successfully wrote 0600 settings/auth files but stdout began with SETUP WIZARD before the requested JSON payload. Fix the non-interactive path to emit one formatter-validated receipt, represent connection-test success/failure in that receipt, keep errors actionable, and preserve the interactive guided experience."
